WEBVTT

00:08:28.537 --> 00:08:31.033
Na licha ya ukali wa
dawa za kutibu,

00:08:31.057 --> 00:08:33.586
ilikua inashindikana
kuondoa mashambulizi.

00:08:34.816 --> 00:08:37.898
Madaktari waliona kua asingeweza
kufikia miaka ya 20.

00:08:40.404 --> 00:08:42.509
Nilipopima kwenye sampuli ya binti huyu,

00:08:42.533 --> 00:08:44.732
kifaa changu kilikua kwenye
hatua za mwanzo.

00:08:44.756 --> 00:08:47.455
Sikujua hata
kama njia yangu ilifanya kazi kabisa,

00:08:47.479 --> 00:08:49.626
hivyo nikawa na makubaliano
na madaktari

00:08:49.650 --> 00:08:51.511
kutowaambia chombo changu
kilichoonyesha

00:08:51.535 --> 00:08:53.675
ili kutokuharibu matibabu yao.

00:08:53.861 --> 00:08:56.914
Hivyo nilipoona haya majibu
ambayo hata hayakuwa yamehakikishwa,

00:08:56.938 --> 00:08:58.290
sikudhubutu kusema

00:08:58.314 --> 00:09:01.121
ka sababu kutibu mgonjwa
bila mashambulizi halisi